{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54410","headline":"悼孟昭图（题拟） · 狄常侍","name":"悼孟昭图（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一何罪死一何名，独向湘江吊屈平。\n从此蜀川春夜月，杜鹃啼作两般声。\n（周校本《诗话总龟》卷四五引卢瓌《抒情》）（按：卢瓌《抒情》云：「僖宗幸蜀，拾遗孟昭门上疏切直，蹈于非罪。\n时狄常侍归蜀，以诗悼之曰〖诗略〗。\n」《全唐诗》卷六○○据《南部新书》卷己、《唐诗纪事》卷六八等书所引，收归裴澈名下。\n《抒情诗》成书较早，诗句差异较大，故两存之。\n狄常侍，疑即狄归昌。\n昭门，显爲昭图之误。\n《全唐诗》作「孟昌图」，亦未谛。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"狄常侍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54410.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54410","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}